[I] SIP User-Agent protocol library

[T] Sofia-SIP is an open-source library implementing the SIP User-Agent
[T] protocol according to IETF RFC3261. It serves as a building block for
[T] SIP-based VoIP, instant messaging and other real-time communication
[T] applications, and is used by projects such as FreeSWITCH.

[U] https://github.com/freeswitch/sofia-sip

[A] FreeSWITCH Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/network

[L] LGPL
[V] 1.13.18

